Summary":"The great classics of our region, shared around the table.","deTag":"EMILIANISCHE TRADITION","deSummary":"Die großen Klassiker unserer Region, gemeinsam am Tisch genießen.","frTag":"LA TRADITION ÉMILIENNE","frSummary":"Les grands classiques de notre région, à partager autour de la table.","esTag":"TRADICIÓN DE EMILIA","esSummary":"Los grandes clásicos de nuestra tierra para compartir en la mesa."}');
